From 5ce19c5bd7ac43afebd2ddd7c144c7edf6c0fec9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yofuness <compiledchickennuggets@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:47:06 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] 0242 sunfish: display-dark idle: slower USB/keys/FB pollers,
 touch stopped while the display is off (after iOSPlus10 0382)

Boot-arg sweetdark=0 disables; kern.sweet_display_dark read-only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

v1.1: build fix (AppleCLCD befriends its user client for the fVsync kick).
---
 bsd/conf/files                        |  1 +
 bsd/dev/sweet_dark.c                  | 81 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bsd/dev/sweet_fts.c                   |  8 +++
 bsd/dev/sweet_keys.c                  | 10 +++-
 bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c                 |  7 +++
 bsd/dev/sweet_usb.c                   | 38 ++++++++++++-
 iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp | 28 ++++++++-
 7 files changed, 169 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 bsd/dev/sweet_dark.c

